    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### New to Notebooks like this one? Head over to the guides folder!\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Just to check you've already added the Python and Jupyter extensions to Cursor, if not already installed:\\n\",\n",
